# SIDE JOB - KINGS CORNER (rival gang encounter)
mission 23
key s23
title "Kings Corner"
desc "The Kings have taken the corner past the laundromat and are shaking down everyone who walks by. Varga will pay to see them gone."
start laundromat 20 -1
requires 2
reward 500
side

group kc thug kings 3 @laundromat 40 -2 3 kings fists hostile
group kc gunman kings 2 @laundromat 46 -3 2 kings pistol hostile
name kc "Kings Soldier"
music combat
say thug "This is Kings territory, Cross!"
kill kc "Clear the Kings off the corner"
rep kings -10
rep varga 10
music calm
end
